xact"],["a-s003-0472","و ف ي","B001","root_001669","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0473","و ف ي","B002","root_001669","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0474","و ف ي","B004","root_001669","B004","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0475","و ق د","B001","root_001672","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0476","و ق د","B002","root_001672","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0477","و ق ي","B001","root_001677","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0478","و ق ي","B002","root_001677","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0479","و ك ل","B001","root_001681","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0480","و ك ل","B002","root_001681","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0481","و ل ج","B001","root_001682","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0482","و ل ج","B002","root_001682","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0483","و ل ي","B001","root_001684","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0484","و ل ي","B003","root_001684","B003","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0485","و ل ي","B004","root_001684","B004","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0486","و ل ي","B008","root_001684","B008","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0487","و ه ب","B001","root_001685","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0488","و ه ب","B005","root_001685","B005","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0489","و ه ن","B001","root_001687","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s003-0490","ي د ي","B001","root_001693","B001","resolved_source_exact"]],"review_columns":["anchor_key","source_path","line","ayah_ref","raw_excerpt"],"review_rows":[["a-s003-0113","v12/runs_11ayah/s003/full_context_control/reader_s003_a_ayah_walk.md",946,"3:95","1. **A professed way validated by actually traversing its turn.** Lexically, `م ل ل` B003 is a professed religious way, while B006 is a path worn clear by repeated travel; `ح ن ف` B002 adds deliberate directional inclination. Structurally, God's truth is followed by the imperative `فَٱتَّبِعُوا۟`, and Abraham's `مِلَّة` is qualified both by turning and by non-association. I assign B006 the role of converting B003 from a label into a followable route, with `حَنِيفًا` setting its turn away from the rival orientation. The worn-path model is inferred; truth, following, way, turn, and excluded destination are explicit. Affiliation therefore reads as reproduced movement along Abraham's orientation, not ownership of his name."]]}
